<title>USA: Dynamic Homes FY96 net climbs with sales.</title>
<headline>Dynamic Homes FY96 net climbs with sales.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT LAKES, Minn. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamic Homes Inc said Thursday an increase in sales of single-family construction helped earnings rise in 1996 versus 1995.</p>
<p>The regional home builder posted net income of $908,000, or $0.38 a share, for the year, up from $809,000, or $0.37, in 1995. Sales rose to $12.2 million from $10.8 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects relatively soft operating results in the first quarter of 1997, reflecting the normal seasonal slowdown in home orders.</p>
<p>Dynamic Homes shares were off 5/32 Thursday at 2-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
